                <head>Naturalization treaty between the United States and Portugal</head>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Washington, May 7, 1908.
                        Ratification advised by the Senate, May 14, 1908. Ratified by the President,
                        November 6, 1908. Ratified by Portugal, September 21, 1908. Ratifications
                        exchanged at Washington, November 14, 1908. Proclaimed, December 14,
                        1908.</hi></p>

